5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Let's find a way to fix the bins that makes everyone happy again! I'll check the ward complaint log and the residents' meeting statements.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It would be lovely to have a peaceful corner. I think I'll look into the station block's bin house and their meeting minutes.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a realistic view of the labor involved. I will investigate the supervised mornings on the next lane and the ward filing requirements.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to make sure it's fair for the person at the gate! I'll check the measurements of the five frontages and the ward complaint log.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"A wise decision requires knowing the true cost. I shall look into the ward subsidy and shelter costs, and the block ledger.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, you're looking at the complaints too? We can compare notes!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I hope the station block found a solution that actually works for the neighbors.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, knowing the budget is important, but the time spent managing it is often the hidden cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,I just don't want one person to be stuck with the smell forever!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience, children. Once we have the facts, the right path will reveal itself.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
