35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, almost all the complaints are from just one house! But people at the meeting said they wouldn't actually stop a neighbor from leaving a bag.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh dear, the station block's bin house smells worse in summer, and they ended up fighting over who sweeps the inside.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The paperwork for a permanent build is tedious, and supervising the bins takes nearly an hour per shift.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Some of our frontages are way too narrow! And Kenji is right, the person at the gate is the one complaining the most.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The costs are higher than one might think. Even with a subsidy, a shelter is expensive, and we already spend quite a bit on nets and deodorants.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if the person at the gate is so unhappy, we definitely have to move it or change how it works.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Servas, if the open pile is already costing us for deodorants, maybe a shelter isn't the magic fix I hoped for.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, if people won't police each other's bags, then ""managed hours"" will just lead to more arguments.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, but if we move it, will it fit? Some of the spots are really tiny!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we are balancing financial burden, physical space, and the harmony of our spirits.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I just want us to be able to talk to each other again without thinking about trash.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"A permanent structure sounds like it might just bring more arguments about cleaning, like at the station block.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,And the administrative burden of filing for every single site change is a nightmare.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"If we can't fit the bins everywhere, maybe we can't rotate them perfectly?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must be careful not to trade a financial debt for a social one.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
