60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Option A is a permanent build, B is rotating the location, and C is managed hours. I think B is the friendliest.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Rotating sounds lovely, but I worry about the narrow spaces Rin mentioned. Managed hours sound stressful.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Option C is out; nobody wants to be the ""bin police"" for an hour. Option A is too much paperwork.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,I love Option B! It's the only one that's actually fair to the person at the gate.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option A is a heavy financial lift for some. Option B is free, but Option C is a lift in labor.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Asuka, if you hate the paperwork of A and the policing of C, you must like B too!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Rin, if we rotate, we just have to be careful about where the bins sit on the narrow frontages.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, as long as the rotation is fixed and doesn't require constant new filings, B is the most logical.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,Exactly! Let's just move the bins every few months so everyone takes a turn.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,Harmony is found when the burden is shared equally. Option B reflects this philosophy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm voting for B. It lets us move past the old fights.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I will vote for B as well. It's the gentlest way to handle it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,B is the only option that doesn't create a permanent administrative or labor trap. I vote B.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,B! B! B! It's the fairest for everyone!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I agree. To protect the budgets of all households, I vote for B.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
